{"ID":"20240206110414-dkczbzx","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206110414-dkczbzx","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206110414-dkczbzx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206110414-mmi4k29\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206110432-7fhn27o\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206110432-7fhn27o\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"虫白蜡","type":"doc","updated":"20240902173641"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206110414-mmi4k29","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206110414-mmi4k29","updated":"20240206110426"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】\t介壳虫科昆虫白蜡虫Ericerus pela (Chavannes) Guerin的雄虫群栖于木犀科植物白蜡树Fraxinus chinensis Roxb.、女贞Ligustrum lucidum Ait.或女贞属他种植物枝干上分泌的蜡，经精制而成。\n【产地】\t主产于贵州、云南、四川、湖南等地。\n【性状】\t整者多为圆形厚块，一般已打碎成不规则块状，大小不一。白色，或微带黄色，不透明或微透明；表面平滑或稍显皱纹，有光泽，触之有滑腻感。体轻，能浮于水面；质硬而稍脆，用手搓捏则粉碎。断面不平正，呈针状结晶形，或显小颗粒状，具玻璃样光泽。有微弱的特异臭气，味淡，嚼之如细沙样。不溶于水、醚及氯仿中，可溶于苯及石油醚中。熔点80"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"83℃。\n【品质】\t以色白、质硬、致密而无气泡。无败油气味者为佳。\n【性味】\t甘，温。\n【功效】\t止血，生肌，定痛。治金疮出血，尿血、下血，疮疡久溃不敛，下疳。"}]},{"ID":"20240206110432-7fhn27o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206110432-7fhn27o","updated":"20240726090506"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 575px;","style":"width: 565px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206110432-92etvbk.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 565px;\" parent-style=\"width: 575px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240726092305-20vlf4r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240726092305-20vlf4r","updated":"20240726094441"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 592px;","style":"width: 582px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白蜡虫 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白蜡虫 2-20240726094434-lenl9yl.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 582px;\" parent-style=\"width: 592px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240726095556-s4lqxzv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240726095556-s4lqxzv","updated":"20240726095733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白蜡虫 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白蜡虫 10-20240726095730-hyxhrnp.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240726094543-7t777eo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240726094543-7t777eo","updated":"20240726094546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 390px;","style":"width: 380px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白蜡虫 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白蜡虫 3-20240726094543-kra1jc7.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 380px;\" parent-style=\"width: 390px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 679px;","style":"width: 669px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白蜡虫 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白蜡虫 1-20240726093414-mhxajo4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 669px;\" parent-style=\"width: 679px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240726094708-7dfn2bq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240726094708-7dfn2bq","updated":"20240726094708"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白蜡虫 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白蜡虫 4-20240726094708-7h2z1gh.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240726094918-upuxxw1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240726094918-upuxxw1","updated":"20240726094918"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白蜡虫 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白蜡虫 5-20240726094918-wcyeznl.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240726095055-rmsy9wj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240726095055-rmsy9wj","updated":"20240726095055"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白蜡虫 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白蜡虫 6-20240726095055-aede532.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240726095245-0a99zi1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240726095245-0a99zi1","updated":"20240726095245"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白蜡虫 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白蜡虫 7-20240726095244-20y93qf.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240726090447-o56t3o3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240726090447-o56t3o3","updated":"20240726094347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：为白蜡虫雄性幼虫的分泌物；枝头上圆圆的果子，是白蜡虫卵，春天时会孵化；"}]},{"ID":"20240726090447-hsrg8ty","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240726090447-hsrg8ty"}},{"ID":"20240902173636-06asko5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-06asko5","updated":"20240902173641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：虫白蜡"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-piq74kz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-piq74kz","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"虫白蜡《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-zemndpm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-zemndpm","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】ChónɡBáiLà"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-808vfvz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-808vfvz","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】CERACHINENSIS"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-qoijkuo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-qoijkuo","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】白蜡、虫蜡、蜡膏"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-q1kfxvi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-q1kfxvi","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】本品为介壳虫科昆虫白蜡虫Ericeruspela（Chavannes）Guerin的雄虫群栖于木犀科植物白蜡树Fraxi-nuschinensisRoxb.、女贞LigustrumlucidumAit.或女贞属他种植物枝干上分泌的蜡，经精制而成。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-nd5ty0c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-nd5ty0c","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】本品呈块状，白色或类白色。表面平滑,或稍有皱纹，具光泽。体轻，质硬而稍脆，搓捻则粉碎。断面呈条状或颗粒状。气微，无味。熔点应为81～85℃（附录ⅦC）。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-le1xjb1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-le1xjb1","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】作为赋形剂，制丸、片的润滑剂。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-8o9td7p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-8o9td7p","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【贮藏】密闭，置阴凉处。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-tp2zn3c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-tp2zn3c","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-5xt55ma","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-5xt55ma","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"虫白蜡《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-c4x0vv9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-c4x0vv9","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】ChónɡBáiLà"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-secfupm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-secfupm","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】白蜡虫Ericeruspela（Chavannes）Guerin的雄虫群栖于木犀科植物白蜡树Fraxi-nuschinensisRoxb.、女贞LigustrumlucidumAit.或女贞属他种植物枝干上分泌的蜡，经精制而成。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-m8849qg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-m8849qg","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】甘，温。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-ycymbux","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-ycymbux","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】止血生肌，敛疮。用于创伤出血，疮口久溃不敛。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-heuc5gj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-heuc5gj","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】多作赋形药入膏丸剂，外用研粉撒敷患处。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-3a02r8r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-3a02r8r","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-n93lo5k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-n93lo5k","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"虫白蜡《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-vhw1m3u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-vhw1m3u","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《本草会编》"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-uhxsgx7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-uhxsgx7","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】ChónɡBáiLà"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-1p3sfi5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-1p3sfi5","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】虫蜡（《本草求真》），木蜡（《新本草纲目》），树蜡（《中国药学大辞典》），蜡膏（《四川中药志》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-pdrith9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-pdrith9","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为介壳虫科昆虫白蜡虫的雄虫，群栖于木犀科植物白蜡树、女贞及女贞属其他种植物枝干上所分泌的白色蜡质，精制而成。8～9月间采蜡。清晨用刀将包有蜡质的树枝切下，名曰\"蜡花\"，放入沸水锅中煮之，使蜡质熔化而浮于水面，冷后凝结成块。取出，再加水加热熔化，过滤后凝固即成。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-31z2lkm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-31z2lkm","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-b72m5qj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-b72m5qj","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雌虫体椭圆形，长1.2～1.5毫米。体表褐色，有深黑斑点。单眼1对，口器为甲壳质针状吸收器。环节不叨显，无翅，触角及足皆不发达。腹面灰黄色，有多个尖棘，沿身体边缘排列。尾端有深凹陷。雄虫体色与雌虫相同。初孵化时，形与雌虫相似，但有粗大的足，腹部有硬棘及很多泌蜡孔。头部两侧有大小不等的单眼各5个；触角l对，分为7节。胸部圆形，有翅1对，长约5毫米，膜质透明。经泌蜡后，虫体变成圆形。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-792ywas","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-792ywas","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白蜡虫雌性无蛹期，雄虫有蛹期。卵分雌雄两性，被一层角质囊包围。春季孵化，雄性幼虫在树枝上固定不动，并分泌白色蜡质，包围体外。蜡质分泌盛时相互连贴一起，使枝条呈雪白色棒状。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-u99u69z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-u99u69z","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】分布湖南、四川、贵州、云南等地。主产四川、湖南、贵州、云南；以四川产量为最大。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-jk37uzt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-jk37uzt","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】完整者多为圆形厚块，一般已打碎成不规则块状，大小不一。白色，或微带黄色，不透明或微透明；表面平滑或稍显皱纹，有光泽，触之有滑腻感。体轻，能浮于水面；质硬而稍脆，用手搓捏则粉碎。断面不平正，呈针状结晶形，或显小颗粒状，具玻璃样光泽。有微弱的特异臭气，味淡，嚼之如细沙样。不溶于水、醚及氯仿中，可溶于苯及石油醚中。熔点80～83℃。以色白、质硬、致密而无气泡。无败油气味者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-p5vko81","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-p5vko81","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-3td4m63","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-3td4m63","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要含大分子量的酯类，其中的醇类为廿六醇、廿七醇、廿八醇、卅醇；其中的酸类为廿六酸、廿七酸、廿八酸、卅酸，及少量的棕榈酸、硬脂酸。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-aijmrv5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-aijmrv5","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"市售虫白蜡的成分主要为脂肪族一价酸的酯类混合物，其含率占总量的93～95％，其中有廿四酸廿八酯、廿四酸蜂花酯、廿四酸蜡酯、蜡酸蜡酯、廿七酸廿七酯、褐煤酸蜡酯、蜂花酸廿七酯。此外，尚含游离的蜂花醇，即卅烷醇1％，树脂1～1.5％，廿七烷2～3％。尚含廿七醇、蜡醇等。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-0cs70kd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-0cs70kd","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因虫白蜡为雄白蜡虫幼虫所分泌，故此幼虫的成分也提供参考。全虫可分虫体及蜡外壳两个部分，虫体（湿重）中油脂类占18.6％，其中大部分（83％）为三甘油酯，也含少量烃类、蜡类、磷脂类、游离脂肪酸、一及二甘油酯等；蜡外壳的油脂类，蜡占92.4％，又含游离脂肪酸及烃类，但未找到三甘油酯及磷脂。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-uuez3x3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-uuez3x3","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-v503wnt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-v503wnt","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘，温。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-736j8oe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-736j8oe","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《纲目》：\"甘，温，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-cts0cdp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-cts0cdp","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《医林纂要》：\"甘淡涩，温。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-wpihvit","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-wpihvit","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-si03rif","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-si03rif","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《会约医镜》：\"入肝经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-a8f1m2p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-a8f1m2p","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草撮要》：\"入手太阴、足厥阴经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-4h5gc7k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-4h5gc7k","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-ze5w1ta","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-ze5w1ta","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"止血，生肌，定痛。治金疮出血，尿血、下血，疮疡久溃不敛，下疳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-pubciif","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-pubciif","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①朱震亨：\"生肌，止血，定痛，补虚，续筋接骨。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-beyujpw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-beyujpw","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《纲目》：\"杀瘵虫。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-8ekr5wa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-8ekr5wa","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《东医宝鉴》：\"止咳止泻，润肺脏，厚肠胃。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-08t6n3p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-08t6n3p","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本经逢原》：\"治下疳；以半两入鲫鱼腹中煮食，治肠红。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-8wcue7n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-8wcue7n","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《医林纂要》：\"补肺敛气。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-4h4rxws","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-4h4rxws","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：入丸、散。外用：熔化调制药膏。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-q3pvzuj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-q3pvzuj","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-0u51dfz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-0u51dfz","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"虫白蜡《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-9madx59","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-9madx59","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-b44lqf8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-b44lqf8","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.出自《本草汇编》：虫白蜡与蜜蜡之白者不同，乃小虫所作也。其虫食冬青树汁，久而化为白脂，粘敷树枝，人谓虫屎着树而然，非也。至秋刮取，以水煮溶，滤置冷水中，则凝聚成块矣。碎之，纹理如白石膏而莹澈。人以和油浇烛，大胜蜜蜡也。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-9mr50p2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-9mr50p2","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《纲目》：唐宋以前浇烛、入药所用白蜡，皆蜜蜡也。此虫白蜡，则自元以来，人始知之，今则为日用物矣。四川、湖广、滇南、闽岭、吴越、东南诸郡皆有之。以川、滇、衡、永产者为胜"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-skap6r5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-skap6r5","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】ChónɡBáiLà"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-p8kwfi6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-p8kwfi6","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】InsectWax"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-vfdpczi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-vfdpczi","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】白蜡、虫蜡、木蜡、树蜡、蜡膏"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-e6gx73a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-e6gx73a","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-q21q3o6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-q21q3o6","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为蚧科（介壳虫科）动物白蜡虫的雄虫所分泌的蜡质精制而成。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-kim14wb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-kim14wb","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：EriceruspelaChavannes"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-2upb5cu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-2upb5cu","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：雄白蜡虫定十后即开始泌蜡，到处暑、白露节前后，蜡花表面开始出现白色蜡丝，应采收蜡花。采收时间最好在晨露未干、雨后初晴或微雨时，蜡花湿润，易于剥下采尽。晴天应先喷水湿润后再采。采收下的蜡花最好当日加工，否则发热、发臭、变色，影响蜡品质。当日来不及加工应摊成薄层晾冷处理。国内白蜡加工采取传统的水煮压榨法，劳动强度大，工效低，含渣质。另一种方法去蒸汽制蜡法，操作简便，劳动强度低，工效高，生产安全而且蜡质好。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-zlo00sd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-zlo00sd","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】白蜡虫，雌虫体椭圆形，长1.2-1.5mm。体表褐色，有深黑斑点。单眼1对，口器为甲壳质针状吸收器。环节不明显，无翅，触角及足皆不发达。腹面灰黄色，有多个尖棘，沿身体边缘排列。尾端有深凹陷。雄虫体色与雌虫相同。初孵化时，形与雌虫相似，但有粗大的足，腹部有硬棘及很多泌蜡孔。头部两侧有大小不等的单眼各5个；触角1对，分为7节。胸部圆形，有翅1对，长约5mm，膜质透明。经泌蜡后，虫体变成圆形。白蜡虫雌性无蛹期，雄虫有蛹期。卵分雌雄两性，被一层角质囊包围。春季孵化，雄性幼虫在树枝上固定不动，并分泌白色蜡质，包围体外。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-9p0hdxt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-9p0hdxt","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-lb8vcbw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-lb8vcbw","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：栖息于木犀科植物白蜡树、女贞及女贞属其他植物枝干上。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-7ptz5tj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-7ptz5tj","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于陕西、山东、江苏、浙江、福建、河南、湖北、湖南、广东、广西、四川、贵州、云南、西藏等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-qzy7y0k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-qzy7y0k","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】性状鉴别，本品呈不规则块状，白色或类白色。表面平滑或稍有皱纹，具蜡样光泽。体轻，质硬而稍脆，搓捻则粉碎。断面呈条状，或颗粒状。气微，味淡。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-zc82082","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-zc82082","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-wpzurnm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-wpzurnm","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.主要含大分子量的酯类，其中的醇类为廿六醇(Cerylalcohol或Hexacosanol)、廿七醇(Heptacosanol)、廿八醇(Octacosanol)、卅醇(Triacontanol)，其中的酸类为廿六酸(Ceroticacid或Hexacosanicacid)、廿七酸(Heptacosanoicacid)、廿八酸(Octacosanoicacid)、卅酸(Triacontanoicacid)及少量的棕榈酸、硬脂酸。市售虫白蜡的成分主要为脂肪族一价酸的酯类混含物，其含率占总量的93-95%，其中有廿四酸廿八酯(Octacosyllignocerate)、廿四酸蜂花酯(Melissyllignocerate2%)、廿四酸蜡酯(Ceryllignoceratel0%)、蜡酸蜡醋(Cerylcerotate15%)、廿七酸廿七酯(Heptacosylheptacosanate60%)、褐煤酸蜡酯(Cerylmontanate)、蜂花酸廿七酯(Heptacosylmelissate)。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-2and0tn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-2and0tn","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.此外，尚含游离的蜂花醇(Melissylalcohol)即卅烷醇1%，树脂1-1.5%，廿七烷(Heptacosane)2-3%。尚含廿七醇(Ibotacerylalcohol)、蜡醇(Cerylalcohol)等。因虫白蜡为雄白蜡虫幼虫所分泌，故此幼虫的成分也提供参考。全虫可分虫体及蜡外壳两个部分，虫体(湿重)中油脂类占18.6%，其中大部分(83%)为三甘油酯，也含少量烃类、蜡类、磷脂类、游离脂肪酸、一及二甘油酯等；蜡外壳的油脂类，蜡占92.4%，又含游离脂肪酸及烃类，但未找到三甘油酯及磷脂。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-oyc7bg3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-oyc7bg3","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】理化鉴别，熔点：81-85℃；酸值：不大于1皂化值：70-92；碘值：不大于9。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-82a1s45","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-82a1s45","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】取原药材，除去杂质，用时捣碎。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-r1lsgoj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-r1lsgoj","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】味甘淡；性温"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-pik83oz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-pik83oz","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】肝经"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-5b3v604","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-5b3v604","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】止血；生肌；定痛。主金疮出血；尿血；便血；疮疡久溃不敛"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-n0l0cle","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-n0l0cle","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：入丸、散，3-6g。外用：适量，熔化调制药膏。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-dx4lq8x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-dx4lq8x","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-ssmgmip","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-ssmgmip","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.生肌，止血，定痛，补虚，续筋接骨。白蜡，禀受收敛坚强之气，为外科要药。与合欢皮同入长肌肉膏中用之效。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-vsa9vu2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-vsa9vu2","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《纲目》：杀瘵虫。蜡树叶，亦治疮肿，故白蜡为外科要药，正如桑螵蛸与桑木之气相通也。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-kalm6u2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-kalm6u2","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《东医宝鉴》：止咳止泻，润肺脏，厚肠胃。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-zmeijwl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-zmeijwl","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《本经逢原》：治下疳；以半两入鲫鱼腹中煮食，治肠红。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-5bu1exx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-5bu1exx","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《医林纂要》：补肺敛气。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-1zp1lks","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-1zp1lks","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《本草求真》：虫蜡，味甘气温。按甘益血补中，温能通经活络，故书载能止痛生肌，补虚续绝，与桑螵蛸同有补虚之意，可为外科圣药。是以郑赞寰云，汪御章尿血，用白蜡加于凉血滋肾药中遂愈，则知虫蜡亦皆生肌活血之味。但蜜蜡味甘淡涩微温，虫蜡则味甘不淡而温也。蜜蜡因有涩性，可以止渴、治痢；虫蜡涩性差减，而痢则鲜用也。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173636-6s7kges","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173636-6s7kges","updated":"20240902173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902173637-e5n0qyj","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240902173637-e5n0qyj","updated":"20240902173659"}},{"ID":"20240902173638-8ftvnn0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173638-8ftvnn0","updated":"20240902173659"}}]}